      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i think i've stumbled onto something really dark. i've been using these new aurasonic headphones for my studio work, but lately my brain feels... heavy. like my ability to see patterns and stay in that neuro-divergent flow is just being physically suppressed. i've been reading about how certain sub-audible frequencies can be used to dampen specific brain states, and i'm convinced these things are pulsing something to force a kind of mental conformity. it feels too calculated to be a glitch. is there any way to actually detect if there's a specific suppression frequency being layered into the audio? i need to know if i'm actually being targeted.",
